# Triage invariants

`main` is the demo. These rules apply on `sdd/factory` and on
`sdd/factory-<key>`. The pull request base is `sdd/factory`. See `AGENTS.md`.

A change is `guard` (`should_skip` before any model call), `gate` (the
confidence branch: retry, fallback), `contract` (field order in `docs/sdd.md`),
`eval` (`evals/`, `scripts/`, `tests/` only), or `STOP`.

Every branch of the reasoning loop gets a FakeLLM test. Repair formatting,
never meaning. `unclear` is written by the worker only. If it can be an `if`,
it is code, not prompt text.

`label_source` stays `model`, `model_retry`, `fallback`, `skipped`.
Nothing under `connect/` sets a category.
